# Test-run artifacts (Bob — 2026-07-09, CI stability audit cleanup):
# *.xcresult bundles and xcresulttool-exported attachment dumps are
# multi-hundred-MB, machine-specific, and regenerated by every test run —
# one previously got committed by accident (no rule caught it). debug/ and
# debug2/ were one-off folders used to hand exported .xcresult attachments
# to Claude for CI failure triage; ignore that naming pattern too so it
# doesn't happen again if the same workflow is used later.
*.xcresult
debug/
debug2/

# Credentials / secrets
*.p8
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
AuthKey_*.p8
